# portal-gateway has no secret in its environment and no .env file (rule 7: every key is listed, none carries a value that is secret).
# Secrets are files, mode 600, owner uid 1000, in /srv/apps/portal/gateway-secrets (mounted read-only at /secrets); none is in git:
#   ha-token          long-lived token of the dedicated NON-admin HA user "portal-gateway" (created offline by tools/ha_create_user.py)
#   sched-admin       schedule-service token, role admin,     flagged gateway (may send X-Acting-User)
#   sched-household   schedule-service token, role household, flagged gateway
# Non-secret settings are the `environment:` list of compose.yaml (GW_BIND, GW_PORT, GW_PUBLIC_URL, GW_HA_URL, GW_SCHED_URL, GW_DATA).
# The one-time setup link for Ivan is written by `gwctl bootstrap` to /srv/apps/portal/gateway/out/setup-ivan.url (mode 600) and is removed by `gwctl clean-out`.
